     "dee3d199-d954-4b9a-b8a4-dcd875d7e7d8"], Cell["\<\
the image of each generator, as a polynomial in the generators\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"4ebdf611-2814-43d4-8c9c-c30d5d12b47e"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
